OL,3,CCambridge University's youngest black
OL,4,Cprofessor resigns amid plagiarism
OL,5,Cclaims
OL,7,FThe University of Cambridge's youngest
OL,8,Fblack professor has resigned from his
OL,9,Fposition following allegations of
OL,10,Fplagiarism against him.
OL,12,FEarlier on Wednesday, the university
OL,13,Fconfirmed it would launch an inquiry
OL,14,Finto Professor Arday, who became its
OL,15,Fyoungest black professor in 2023,
OL,16,F"following new information".
OL,26,@xD@AOUxD@[O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786006083
OL,3,CCambridge University's youngest black
OL,4,Cprofessor resigns amid plagiarism
OL,5,Cclaims
OL,7,FIn a statement, it said the professor
OL,8,Fof sociology's "academic
OL,9,Fqualifications and honorary
OL,10,Fappointments" would be examined,
OL,11,Ffollowing allegations he had
OL,12,Fplagiarised his PhD thesis and other
OL,13,Fpublished research.
OL,15,FProfessor Arday then announced his
OL,16,Fresignation, stating that the move
OL,17,Fshould not be interpreted as "an
OL,18,Facceptance of the narratives that have
OL,19,Fsurrounded me".
OL,26,@pD@POUrD@MO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786006083
OL,3,CCambridge University's youngest black
OL,4,Cprofessor resigns amid plagiarism
OL,5,Cclaims
OL,7,FIn a statement on non-profit the Good
OL,8,FLaw Project's website, he said he had
OL,9,Ffaced "an unrelenting level of public
OL,10,Fscrutiny and personal attack", that
OL,11,Fhad gone "far beyond scholarly
OL,12,Fdisagreement".
OL,14,F"It is with profound sadness that I
OL,15,Fwrite to resign, with immediate
OL,16,Feffect, from my position at the
OL,17,FUniversity of Cambridge and Jesus
OL,18,FCollege," Professor Arday said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
