CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786006083
OL,3,CCambridge University's youngest black
OL,4,Cprofessor resigns amid plagiarism
OL,5,Cclaims
OL,7,FSubscribe free to our weekly
OL,8,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,9,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,10,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,12,FHe continued: "This decision should
OL,13,Fnot be interpreted as a loss of faith
OL,14,Fin scholarship or in the values that
OL,15,Ffirst brought me to Cambridge. Nor
OL,16,Fshould it be mistaken for an
OL,17,Facceptance of the narratives that have
OL,18,Fsurrounded me.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786006083
OL,3,CCambridge University's youngest black
OL,4,Cprofessor resigns amid plagiarism
OL,5,Cclaims
OL,7,F"It is simply the decision of someone
OL,8,Fwho has reached the limits of what any
OL,9,Fperson should reasonably be expected
OL,10,Fto endure."
OL,12,FHe described becoming professor of
OL,13,Fsociology at Cambridge and teaching
OL,14,Fstudents as the "greatest professional
OL,15,Fprivilege" of his life, but said the
OL,16,Fpersonal cost was too great.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
