PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786006083
OL,3,CCambridge University's youngest black
OL,4,Cprofessor resigns amid plagiarism
OL,5,Cclaims
OL,7,F"For my own wellbeing, for my family,
OL,8,Fand for those who have stood by me
OL,9,Fthroughout this difficult period, I
OL,10,Fhave concluded that the only way to
OL,11,Fbring this chapter to an end is to
OL,12,Fstep away," the academic said.
OL,14,FThe University of Cambridge said they
OL,15,Fwould investigate the professor
OL,16,F"following new information about his
OL,17,Facademic qualifications and honorary
OL,18,Fappointments".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
