PN,31107
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786006083
OL,3,CCambridge University's youngest black
OL,4,Cprofessor resigns amid plagiarism
OL,5,Cclaims
OL,7,FIt said: "Separately, there remains a
OL,8,Fnumber of ongoing complaints regarding
OL,9,Facademic misconduct, which are being
OL,10,Fhandled in line with our misconduct in
OL,11,Fresearch policy.
OL,13,F"This is consistent with our previous
OL,14,Fstatement on the matter.
OL,16,F"While we are fully aware of the
OL,17,Fpublic commentary and concerns around
OL,18,Fthis matter, it remains vital that any
OL,19,Fprocess is thorough and adheres to
OL,20,Fboth university policies and
OL,21,Femployment law.
OL,26,@oD@JOUxD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
