PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786006083
OL,3,CCambridge University's youngest black
OL,4,Cprofessor resigns amid plagiarism
OL,5,Cclaims
OL,7,F"We also fully recognise that there is
OL,8,Fa person at the centre of this
OL,9,Fsituation and we continue to provide
OL,10,Fsupport to him."
OL,12,FA spokesperson for Jesus College said
OL,13,Fthey were also launching their own
OL,14,Finvestigation.
OL,16,F"Professor Arday remains a fellow
OL,17,Fduring this process. We recognise that
OL,18,Fthis is a very difficult time for him
OL,19,Fand his family, and ask that they are
OL,20,Ftreated with compassion and respect,"
OL,21,Fthey said.
OL,26,@oD@AOUxD@AOU|D@eO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/12
