OL,3,CCambridge University's youngest black
OL,4,Cprofessor resigns amid plagiarism
OL,5,Cclaims
OL,7,FProfessor Arday has denied claims of
OL,8,Fplagiarism, which first surfaced in
OL,9,FJuly this year, and relate to his
OL,10,Fpublished work, including his PhD
OL,11,Fthesis.
OL,13,FAt the time, Cambridge said the
OL,14,Fprofessor had been the victim of a
OL,15,F"vile campaign to undermine his
OL,16,Fcredibility".
OL,26,@wD@AOUxD@LO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31110
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786006083
OL,3,CCambridge University's youngest black
OL,4,Cprofessor resigns amid plagiarism
OL,5,Cclaims
OL,7,FProfessor Arday told The Times: "I am
OL,8,Faccountable for the mistakes I've
OL,9,Fmade. I hold myself accountable and
OL,10,Fother people should hold me
OL,11,Faccountable.
OL,13,F"We're talking about academia here. I
OL,14,Fdidn't murder somebody. I think the
OL,15,Fcruelty that I've experienced and the
OL,16,Fpositioning of me as this kind of liar
OL,17,Fand fantasist is totally unacceptable."
OL,26,@oD@aOUuD@AOUyD@gO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
