OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786006083
OL,3,CCambridge University's youngest black
OL,4,Cprofessor resigns amid plagiarism
OL,5,Cclaims
OL,7,FIn 2023, Professor Arday became the
OL,8,Fyoungest Black professor in the
OL,9,FUniversity of Cambridge's history aged
OL,10,F37.
OL,12,FIn his resignation, he described the
OL,13,Fmoment as "something I could scarcely
OL,14,Fhave imagined as a child growing up
OL,15,Fwith a diagnosis of autism, unable to
OL,16,Fspeak until I was 11 years old."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31112
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786006083
OL,3,CCambridge University's youngest black
OL,4,Cprofessor resigns amid plagiarism
OL,5,Cclaims
OL,7,FAn online open letter, organised by
OL,8,Fthe Good Law Project in solidarity
OL,9,Fwith Prof Arday, has been signed by
OL,10,Fnearly 16,000 people, including
OL,11,Fmultiple MPs, Lords and academics, as
OL,12,Fwell as Green Party leader Zack
OL,13,FPolanski.
OL,15,FProfessor Arday's memoir, Great And
OL,16,FUnfortunate Things, is due to be
OL,17,Fpublished by Simon & Schuster later
OL,18,Fthis month.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/12
